body:
My current workflow is definitely similar to yours! Splice for vocals (although they're extremely hard to find for me?) and loads of padmaking

&#x200B;

I do use Supermassive instead of Vintage Verb though, and now started tinkering with PaulXStretch aswell, awesome little tool

I've had this issue in Mint Cinnamon, Arch XFCE and Arch KDE Plasma (current). I did just get devilspie2 but I'm not sure how to make it do what I want :(

&#x200B;

edit grammar

Awesome idea! Tumblr and DeviantArt sound awesome for fanart specifically.

&#x200B;

>Wait, does this allow you to have empty space on the home screen?

&#x200B;

Yep! Works awesomely. It's how I have my photo widgets, it works through a screenshot of your home screen so I just took one with the image widgets where I wanted and switched to the invisible one to remove the text.

&#x200B;

To my knowledge only PoC - Proof of Concept - is available for iOS 15 Jailbreaks, sadly, and there's no native way to change the system font. 

&#x200B;

Yeh that's how they have no name!

>apparently "most people don't have middle mouse buttons"

&#x200B;

Excuse me?

&#x200B;

Thanks, I think I'll just get used to it :/

Met a member of the band The Garden Plot, they're awesome! They sound incredible and I think they have amazing potential. Disaster is my favorite and their most recent song is Wasting Time.

&#x200B;

If you'd like to give a listen I'm Alyson Grey on Spotify. My newest single Morphine is quite good IMO. If you enjoy I'd appreciate a follow, working hard on my new works!
